	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quod toties, reverende in Christo pater, tibi occupatissimo <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>naenias meas obtrudo, me ipsum quidem piget pudetque.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Sed quid aliud faciam, cum incredibilis tua humanitas <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>has scribendi leges mihi primitus imposuerit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Nunc praeterquam quod inanes ad te mitto, precibus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>meis insuper a te contendere ausim, ut has meas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>alteras ad illustrem virum d. <persName ref="p2054">Martinengum</persName> mittas; <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>id ita ut faciam, ingens me cogit necessitas.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Audio <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>responsum meum ibi esse sub praelo; specimen eius <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>rei vel maculaturam, ut appellant, ad me misit <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><persName ref="p2054">Martinengus</persName>; rogat, negotium dem hominibus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>certis, qui exemplaria istinc ad nos asportent.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Sed commodum incidi in Pellizarios, quibus ego <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>iam diu inservio; hi affirmant <persName>Hieronimum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Pellizarium</persName>, qui <placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName> versatur, huc ad nos <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>venire cogitare intra 14 dies; si literae meae <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>tempestive curentur, eum non invitum exemplaria <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sarcinis suis adiecturum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si ergo fines pudoris <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>transilio, necessitas me excusare apud te potest.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Utinam autem essent certi homines, qui mature <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>perferrent, de quo tamen optime spero; si enim <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> mittuntur, inde <placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName> nullum erit <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>periculum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si <persName>Pellizarius</persName>, ad quem caeteri scribunt <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName>Pellizarii</persName>, hanc curam ad se recipit, multa <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nos molestia in posterum liberabit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Caetera tua libentissime legi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Si <persName>Augustus</persName> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>vivit, miror temeritatem hominum, qui in men<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>daciis cudendis tam sunt foecundi et ingeniosi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Dominum de Bellieure virum cognovi prudentem <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et doctum, integrum etiam iudico et alienum a fuco.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Sed non tam ab illo molestias timebam quam ab ipso negotio, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>quod varium est et multiplex.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Es gibt vyl unruͦw, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>und seit mir yeder ettwas, einer meints guͦtt, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>der ander böß.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Sed mirabar te illi in tuis ad <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nos salutem ascribere, cum nusquam hic appareat; <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>sed fortassis in via est.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Acta <placeName ref="l176">Glaronensia</placeName> legi; attulit <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>secum <persName ref="p1770">Gregorius Carlin</persName>, qui addebat se tui salutandi <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>gratia te domi convenisse.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Pestis <placeName ref="l98">Curiae</placeName> nulla, sed <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>nos undique cingit; abripuit tres sacrificulos, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>qui suis singuli praefuerunt ecclesiis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Expectamus et <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>nos, quid dominus de nobis constituat.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Tuos <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>sic intrepidos se praestare gaudeo equidem; de tua <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>constantia et fortitudine nihil dubitavi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Deum <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>rogo, ut misericordia sua nos clementer respiciat.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Vale, reverende in Christo pater, cum omnibus tuis diutissime <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>et felicissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Nostri d. d. consules te salvum cupiunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Salutem etiam ascribere iussit <persName ref="p1770">Georgius Carlin</persName>.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 11. septembris anno 1564.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z23"/>Tui observantissi<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>mus <persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Hütt hand unsere herren brieff empfangen von <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>der regierung <placeName ref="l232">Yßbruck</placeName>; zeigt der bott an, <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>das die regierung verruckt von wägen der <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>pestilentz, so yngefallen.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">Also last es sich <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>ansächen, das ein algemeines landsstärben <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>volgen wärde; by uns stirbt es in den allerh<lb xml:id="p3z7"/>öchsten wildinen, daa man ettwan den tod <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>hin geflochen ist.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Amplissimo viro domino <lb xml:id="p4z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>domino suo et in Christo <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>patri reverendo.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
